#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The KMT is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @left: Cooperation with the Communists should be prioritized.
- @center_left: Wang Jingwei can lead us through the storm.
- @center: We should stay in the middle, probably.
- @right: We should cut ties with the Communists and keep conservative policies.
- @whampoa: Our military arm deserves some attention.
- @easy_discard

@left
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 5; right_dissent += 5; gxc_relation -= 3; yun_relation -= 3; cpc_relation += 3;

The radical left of the party supports cooperation with the Communists.

@center_left
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "center_leftist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "center_leftist"; center_left_strength += 10; center_left_dissent -= 10;

The Leftists supporting Wang Jingwei seeks to cooperate with the CPC.

@center
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; right_dissent -= 5; center_left_dissent -= 5;

The Centrists are mostly neutral and act as a mediatory force in the party.

@right
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "right") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "right"; right_strength += 10; right_dissent -= 5; cpc_relation -= 8; left_dissent += 8; center_left_dissent += 5;

The right wing of our party seeks to cut ties with the Communists and establish a conservative government.

@whampoa
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "nra") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "nra"; whampoa_strength += 10; whampoa_dissent -= 5; right_strength += 3; right_dissent -= 5; cpc_relation -= 8; left_dissent += 8; center_left_dissent += 5;

The new officers of the NRA have been given more influence within the party.


@changed
on-arrival: left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; center_left_dissent += 5; right_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
